sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as WorkRequestChat.razor<br/>(Browser / WASM)
    participant RBus as RemotableBus
    participant GW as PublisherGateway
    participant API as SingleApiController<br/>(UI.Server)
    participant SBus as ServerRealtimeBus<br/>(MediatR)
    participant H as WorkRequestChatHandler
    participant WT as WorkRequestTool<br/>(2 local methods)
    participant DB as IBus -> EF Core -> SQL
    participant CF as ChatClientFactory
    participant AOAI as Azure OpenAI

    Note over UI: renders only when a WorkRequest<br/>with an assignee is selected<br/>(WorkRequestSelectedEvent)

    User->>UI: type message + Send
    UI->>RBus: Bus.Send(WorkRequestChatQuery)
    Note over RBus: implements IRemotableRequest<br/>-> send over the wire
    RBus->>GW: Publish(request)
    GW->>API: HTTP POST /api/... (X-API-Key)
    API->>SBus: bus.Send(remotableRequest)
    SBus->>H: WorkRequestChatQuery(prompt, currentWorkRequest)

    Note over H: builds 2 tools directly via<br/>AIFunctionFactory.Create(...)<br/>NO MCP / ToolProvider
    H->>WT: AIFunctionFactory.Create(GetWorkRequestByNumber, GetAllEmployees)

    H->>CF: GetChatClient()
    CF->>SBus: ChatClientConfigQuery (AI_OpenAI_*)
    SBus-->>CF: endpoint / model / key
    CF-->>H: IChatClient (UseFunctionInvocation)

    Note over H: system prompt scoped to<br/>WorkRequest.Number
    H->>AOAI: GetResponseAsync(systemPrompt + prompt + tools)

    loop tool-calling loop (automatic)
        AOAI-->>H: tool call request (e.g. GetWorkRequestByNumber)
        H->>WT: invoke local method
        WT->>DB: IBus.Send(WorkRequestByNumberQuery / EmployeeGetAllQuery)
        DB-->>WT: WorkRequest / Employee data
        WT-->>H: tool result
        H->>AOAI: tool result
    end

    AOAI-->>H: final ChatResponse.Text
    H-->>SBus: ChatResponse
    SBus-->>API: result
    API-->>GW: WebServiceMessage (JSON)
    GW-->>RBus: response
    RBus-->>UI: ChatResponse
    UI-->>User: render assistant message
